{
  /**
   * STRICT RATCHET
   * ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   * The full codebase cannot satisfy `strict` yet. Rather than a big-bang
   * migration, this config applies the strict flags to an explicit allowlist of
   * already-migrated root files/folders. Note that TypeScript still type-checks
   * anything those roots import transitively (e.g. `contexts/index.ts` re-exports
   * most of the feature contexts under `src/features`), so the real checked
   * surface is larger than `include` alone suggests — that's expected, not a
   * bug in this config.
   *
   * The rule: `include` only ever grows, never shrinks. Migrate one directory
   * (or one feature) at a time, add it here, and it can never regress.
   *
   * CI runs this in a separate `typecheck:strict` job from the baseline
   * `typecheck` job — see .github/workflows/ci.yml.
   *
   * ── Deferred: exactOptionalPropertyTypes ──────────────────────────────────
   * Left OFF here even though Phase 1 called for it, because turning it on
   * surfaces 13 errors that require widening optional fields to `T | undefined`
   * in interface declarations (a shape change, not a call-site fix) across:
   *   - src/features/finishing/contexts/FinishingContext.tsx  (4)
   *   - src/features/suppliers/contexts/SupplierContext.tsx  (2)
   *   - src/features/purchasing/contexts/POContext.tsx        (2)
   *   - src/features/customers/contexts/SalesContext.tsx      (2)
   *   - src/features/bulk-orders/contexts/BulkOrderContext.tsx (2)
   *   - src/features/qc/contexts/QcContext.tsx                 (1)
   * Tracked as the next ratchet step — fix those 6 files, then flip this flag
   * to true and re-run `npm run typecheck:strict` to confirm 0 errors before
   * committing the change.
   */
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "strict": true,
    "noUnusedLocals": true,
    "noUnusedParameters": true,
    "noUncheckedIndexedAccess": true,
    "exactOptionalPropertyTypes": false,
    "noImplicitOverride": true,
    "noImplicitReturns": true
  },
  "include": [
    "src/lib",
    "src/hooks",
    "src/contexts",
    "src/vite-env.d.ts"
  ]
}
